<title>USA: U.S. wheat weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. wheat major net sales activity in the week ended Sept 12 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:    1996/97		   1997/98</p>
<p> Japan	  106,200		    Nil</p>
<p> Egypt	   55,000</p>
<p> Mexico	  37,000</p>
<p> Yemen	   33,000</p>
<p> Poland	  30,000</p>
<p> Unknown     -114,000</p>
<p> Peru	   -23,900</p>
<p>Net sales of 425,500 tonnes were one-quarter below the previous week and one-fifth under the four-week average.</p>
<p>Exports of 772,400 tonnes were 19 percent lower than the prior week.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Egypt, Japan, Pakistan, Mexico, Nigeria and South Africa.</p>
</text>
